{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 280, "line_no": 2, "text": "或举行婚丧仪礼时收受贡物。师爷协助亭目管理政务、办理文案，同时兼任亭目家庭塾", "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 270, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "或举行婚丧仪礼时收受贡物。师爷协助亭目管理政务、办理文案，同时兼任亭目家庭塾", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 270, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 280, "line_no": 3, "text": "师，教育亭目子弟读书。师爷多由汉族秀才充任。老总头管理衙门内部差人兼管理监狱", "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 334, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "师，教育亭目子弟读书。师爷多由汉族秀才充任。老总头管理衙门内部差人兼管理监狱", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 334, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 280, "line_no": 4, "text": "等；士兵抽农民充当。其名额根据各亭目大小而定，一般为10~20名，也有的多至50人。", "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 402, "w": 1548, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "等；士兵抽农民充当。其名额根据各亭目大小而定，一般为10~20名，也有的多至50人。", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 402, "w": 1548, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 280, "line_no": 5, "text": "士兵负责维持治安，看守监狱，待候亭目等。把事多为亭目之心腹，他们负责催收粮银，", "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 471, "w": 1544, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "士兵负责维持治安，看守监狱，待候亭目等。把事多为亭目之心腹，他们负责催收粮银，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 471, "w": 1544, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 280, "line_no": 6, "text": "传达民间事务，不称职者，随时可以撤换。民间纠纷诉讼，必先由把事调解，调解不了的", "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 535, "w": 1540, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "传达民间事务，不称职者，随时可以撤换。民间纠纷诉讼，必先由把事调解，调解不了的", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 535, "w": 1540, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 280, "line_no": 7, "text": "才送请亭目解决。每个自然村寨设把事一人或二三人不等（视村寨大小而定）。", "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 599, "w": 1379, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "才送请亭目解决。每个自然村寨设把事一人或二三人不等（视村寨大小而定）。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 599, "w": 1379, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 280, "line_no": 8, "text": "其军事组织称“甲”，首领称“甲首”", "bbox_px": {"x": 193, "y": 660, "w": 615, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "其军事组织称“甲”，首领称“甲首”", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 193, "y": 660, "w": 615, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 280, "line_no": 9, "text": "，由土官统管。甲首通常由嫡长子承袭；不继承甲", "bbox_px": {"x": 792, "y": 664, "w": 860, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "，由土官统管。甲首通常由嫡长子承袭；不继承甲", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 792, "y": 664, "w": 860, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 280, "line_no": 10, "text": "首的诸子，分派各地为“亭目”", "bbox_px": {"x": 116, "y": 720, "w": 520, "h": 60}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "首的诸子，分派各地为“亭目”", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 116, "y": 720, "w": 520, "h": 60}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 280, "line_no": 11, "text": "。“甲”与“亭”为上下级关系。“甲”后发展为一级封建政", "bbox_px": {"x": 623, "y": 720, "w": 1033, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "。“甲”与“亭”为上下级关系。“甲”后发展为一级封建政", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 623, "y": 720, "w": 1033, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 280, "line_no": 12, "text": "权，担负统兵、征赋、治安等职责。“改土归流”后，因拨粤归黔以红水河为界，有的“甲”被", "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 789, "w": 1544, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "权，担负统兵、征赋、治安等职责。“改土归流”后，因拨粤归黔以红水河为界，有的“甲”被", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 789, "w": 1544, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 280, "line_no": 13, "text": "一分为二，于是出现“半甲”之称。", "bbox_px": {"x": 109, "y": 853, "w": 587, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "一分为二，于是出现“半甲”之称。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 109, "y": 853, "w": 587, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 280, "line_no": 14, "text": "明代，土司将其世袭领地分为“公田”、“私田”两类。“公田”又分为“粮田”、“夫", "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 917, "w": 1459, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "明代，土司将其世袭领地分为“公田”、“私田”两类。“公田”又分为“粮田”、“夫", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 917, "w": 1459, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 280, "line_no": 15, "text": "田”，“站田”、“马排田”、“祭祀田”五种。“粮田”，布依语称“纳粮”，意即缴纳皇粮的田。", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 982, "w": 1544, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "田”，“站田”、“马排田”、“祭祀田”五种。“粮田”，布依语称“纳粮”，意即缴纳皇粮的田。", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 982, "w": 1544, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 280, "line_no": 16, "text": "多由布依族老户耕种，秋收后向土官纳租。耕种粮田的土民使用自己的生产劳动工具，", "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 1050, "w": 1548, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "多由布依族老户耕种，秋收后向土官纳租。耕种粮田的土民使用自己的生产劳动工具，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 1050, "w": 1548, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 280, "line_no": 17, "text": "农产品归耕者所有，但须负责“印田”、“把事田”的耕种或者缴纳粮赋。“夫田”即夫差", "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 1110, "w": 1544, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "农产品归耕者所有，但须负责“印田”、“把事田”的耕种或者缴纳粮赋。“夫田”即夫差", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 1110, "w": 1544, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 280, "line_no": 18, "text": "田，布依语称“纳夫”。种田者必须承担某种差役。以差役的类别称呼田名，如：伙夫田、", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1175, "w": 1544, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "田，布依语称“纳夫”。种田者必须承担某种差役。以差役的类别称呼田名，如：伙夫田、", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1175, "w": 1544, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 280, "line_no": 19, "text": "挑水田、春米田、柴火田、小菜田、 户田、针线田、筷子田、班夫田、四脚马田、奶妈田、打", "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 1247, "w": 1544, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "挑水田、春米田、柴火田、小菜田、 户田、针线田、筷子田、班夫田、四脚马田、奶妈田、打", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 1247, "w": 1544, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 280, "line_no": 20, "text": "更田、马草田、火药田、摩公田，等等。“站田”，又称栈田，种田者不纳粮，亦不服劳役，一", "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 1308, "w": 1548, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "更田、马草田、火药田、摩公田，等等。“站田”，又称栈田，种田者不纳粮，亦不服劳役，一", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 1308, "w": 1548, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 280, "line_no": 21, "text": "般都住在交通沿线，负责接待过往土官及内地驿卒等。“马排田”，又称兵田，种田者必须", "bbox_px": {"x": 112, "y": 1365, "w": 1544, "h": 69}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "般都住在交通沿线，负责接待过往土官及内地驿卒等。“马排田”，又称兵田，种田者必须", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 112, "y": 1365, "w": 1544, "h": 69}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 280, "line_no": 22, "text": "服兵役。“祭祀田”", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1436, "w": 334, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "服兵役。“祭祀田”", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1436, "w": 334, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 280, "line_no": 23, "text": "，种田者每年纳租，供土官祭祀祖先或寨神之用。这些地租形式比较", "bbox_px": {"x": 442, "y": 1440, "w": 1214, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "，种田者每年纳租，供土官祭祀祖先或寨神之用。这些地租形式比较", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 442, "y": 1440, "w": 1214, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 280, "line_no": 24, "text": "固定，耕种者可世袭耕种，但无所有权，不得买卖和典让。", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1505, "w": 981, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "固定，耕种者可世袭耕种，但无所有权，不得买卖和典让。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1505, "w": 981, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 280, "line_no": 25, "text": "“私田”有两种：印田和把事田。“印田”又称亭目田，布依语称“纳印”，意为掌印人", "bbox_px": {"x": 193, "y": 1565, "w": 1463, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "“私田”有两种：印田和把事田。“印田”又称亭目田，布依语称“纳印”，意为掌印人", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 193, "y": 1565, "w": 1463, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 280, "line_no": 26, "text": "的田。印田由当地农民代耕。“印田”带有“职田”性质，亦称“俸禄田”。“把事田”，又称", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1629, "w": 1540, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "的田。印田由当地农民代耕。“印田”带有“职田”性质，亦称“俸禄田”。“把事田”，又称", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1629, "w": 1540, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 280, "line_no": 27, "text": "“头人田”，布依语称“纳赶”。它是土官赐予下属职员作薪俸的田地，附近农民代耕，农产", "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 1694, "w": 1544, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "“头人田”，布依语称“纳赶”。它是土官赐予下属职员作薪俸的田地，附近农民代耕，农产", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 1694, "w": 1544, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 280, "line_no": 28, "text": "品全归把事所有。把事田不世袭，把事去职后，土官再将田分给新任者。", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1762, "w": 1246, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "品全归把事所有。把事田不世袭，把事去职后，土官再将田分给新任者。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1762, "w": 1246, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 280, "line_no": 29, "text": "在领主经济制度下，布依族人民被划分为土官和土民两大阶级。土官世代享受俸", "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 1823, "w": 1463, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "在领主经济制度下，布依族人民被划分为土官和土民两大阶级。土官世代享受俸", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 1823, "w": 1463, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 280, "line_no": 30, "text": "禄。土民则租种土官的田地，向土官交纳粮租，受到土官的剥削和压迫。土民分为三个", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1895, "w": 1540, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "禄。土民则租种土官的田地，向土官交纳粮租，受到土官的剥削和压迫。土民分为三个", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1895, "w": 1540, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 280, "line_no": 31, "text": "等级：一是耕种粮田的土民，被称为“粮庄百姓”，简称“粮庄”。这个阶层人数较多，具有", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1955, "w": 1540, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "等级：一是耕种粮田的土民，被称为“粮庄百姓”，简称“粮庄”。这个阶层人数较多，具有", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1955, "w": 1540, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 280, "line_no": 32, "text": "依附农民的性质，在土民中地位较高。二是被束缚于亭目私田的百姓。他们由外地来投", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 2024, "w": 1540, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "依附农民的性质，在土民中地位较高。二是被束缚于亭目私田的百姓。他们由外地来投", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 2024, "w": 1540, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 280, "line_no": 33, "text": "靠土司、土官，没有粮田耕种。由土官指定范围，让他们开荒、耕种。耕种这种田地，不交", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 2088, "w": 1540, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "靠土司、土官，没有粮田耕种。由土官指定范围，让他们开荒、耕种。耕种这种田地，不交", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 2088, "w": 1540, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 280, "line_no": 34, "text": "赋税，但必须直接给当地土官交纳名目繁多的“礼品”", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 2148, "w": 953, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "赋税，但必须直接给当地土官交纳名目繁多的“礼品”", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 2148, "w": 953, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
